# This repo is a docs mirror of the openephemeris monorepo. `check:public` in
# the monorepo compares these files BYTE-for-byte against their source copies,
# which are stored and checked out with LF.
#
# Without this file, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites every
# text file to CRLF, so check:public reports permanent drift on files nobody
# edited (LICENSE, README.md, CHANGELOG.md) and `npm run verify:release` — and
# therefore `npm publish` — fails until someone re-syncs by hand.
#
# Pin everything to LF so a checkout here matches the monorepo exactly.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
